76 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (The BiLSTM model was trained from scratch. Text is converted into token IDs, passed through an embedding layer, then through a bidirectional LSTM. The final representation is used to score each answer option. Bidirectional processing helps the model read the sequence in both directions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
