78 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (DeBERTa was the main fine-tuned transformer model. For each question, I created five pairs: question+A, question+B, and so on. The model gives one score for each pair, and softmax converts those scores into five probabilities. The option with the highest probability becomes the first prediction.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
