/Title (5.1 Experiment Tracking with WandB The notebook successfully connects to Weights & Biases \(WandB\). It creates runs for the BiLSTM, DeBERTa, Qwen, and the three-model comparison. The BiLSTM run logs epoch and training loss, DeBERTa is tracked through the Hugging Face Trainer,  Qwen logs evaluation metrics, and the comparison run logs the model-comparison table. The notebook confirms the tracking code and successful connection, but it does not contain screenshots from the WandB website.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 366 0 R
/Prev 373 0 R
>>
