/Title (I deployed the DeBERTa model on Hugging Face Spaces using Gradio. The app accepts one question and five options, Then it shows the top three answers with probabilities. The deployment package contains app.py, config.json, model.safetensors, tokenizer files, requirements.txt and  README.md. Because my account could not switch to CPU Basic without a paid plan, I used ZeroGPU. For ZeroGPU, the prediction function was decorated with spaces.GPU and the app successfully loaded the 738 MB model.)
