/Title (During training, I faced a few environmental issues. For example, FP16 training produced an 'unscale FP16 gradients' error, so I used float32. I also had Kaggle session restarts where variables such as tr_df, val_df, or deberta_trainer were lost. I fixed these by making the notebook order clearer and by saving checkpoints after training.)
