/Title (6.2 Experiment Tracking Weights & Biases \(WandB\) was used for experiment tracking when the API key was available. The goal was to compare common metrics such as accuracy, macro-F1, and MAP@3 across different runs. For deployment-only reruns, WandB was disabled so that missing login details did not stop training.)
